  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If a F4/F5 export is interrupted or fails there is currently no way to resume the export, and it must be restarted from the beginning. This is especially problematic when attempting to export large repositories that may experience intermittent failures.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
